<title>BULGARIA: NO DEALS ON BULGARIA BOURSES, RABSI UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>NO DEALS ON BULGARIA BOURSES, RABSI UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The RABSI (Reuter All Bulgaria Stock Index) was unchanged from Monday's 41.02 points as no corporate stocks traded on Bulgarian bourses for a second day in a row, brokers said.</p>
<p>No repo deals were struck on Bulgarian exchanges either.</p>
<p>-- Dessislava Popova, Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
